### cadastrar cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "nome",
    "email": "email@email.com",
    "senha": "senha",
    "cpf": "12345678910",
    "telefone": "telefone"
}

###Login

# @name valToken
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "email@email.com",
    "senha": "senha"
}
###

### consultar cliente id
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### listar clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### atualizar cliente
PATCH http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "telefone": "novo telefone"
}

### deletar cliente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### cadastrar drone
POST http://localhost:3000/drone
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "modelo": "modelo",
    "marca": "marca",
    "numeroSerie": "placa",
    "tipo": "rastreador",
    "idCliente": "3"
}

### listar drones
GET http://localhost:3000/drones
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json


###cadastrar agendamentos

POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": "09-19-2008",
    "horario": "19:01",
    "tipo": "a",
    "idCliente": "3",
    "idDrone": "1"
}

### listar drones
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json